 "_t1/npm/out/scripts": "$ grep -A 4 '\"scripts\"' package.json\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"node index.js\",\n    \"dev\": \"nodemon index.js\",\n    \"test\": \"node --test\"\n  },\n$ npm run\nLifecycle scripts included in shop@1.0.0:\n  start\n    node index.js\n  test\n    node --test\navailable via `npm run-script`:\n  dev\n    nodemon index.js\n$ npm start -- Minh\n\n> shop@1.0.0 start\n> node index.js Minh\n\nHello, Minh!\nLaunch day: Tuesday 1 December 2026\nDays from 2026-11-02: 29\n$ npm test\n\n> shop@1.0.0 test\n> node --test\n\nTAP version 13\n# Subtest: dayjs counts days between two dates\nok 1 - dayjs counts days between two dates\n  ---\n  duration_ms …\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n1..1\n# tests 1\n# suites 0\n# pass 1\n# fail 0\n# cancelled 0\n# skipped 0\n# todo 0\n# duration_ms …\n$ npm run strat\nnpm error Missing script: \"strat\"\nnpm error\nnpm error To see a list of scripts, run:\nnpm error   npm run\nnpm error A complete log of this run can be found in: ~/.npm/_logs/<time>-debug-0.log",
