 "_t8/out/injection": "Search box: \"SQL\"\n  SQL sent: SELECT id, title FROM posts WHERE published = 1 AND title LIKE '%SQL%'\n  → 1 rows: 2 Learning SQL\n\nSearch box: \"%' OR 1=1 --\"   (unsafe)\n  SQL sent: SELECT id, title FROM posts WHERE published = 1 AND title LIKE '%%' OR 1=1 --%'\n  → 6 rows: 1 Hello World | 2 Learning SQL | 3 Draft Post | 4 Node.js Basics | 5 Old Announcement | 6 Orphan Draft\n\nSearch box: \"x' UNION SELECT id, email FROM users --\"   (unsafe)\n  SQL sent: SELECT id, title FROM posts WHERE published = 1 AND title LIKE '%x' UNION SELECT id, email FROM users --%'\n  → 3 rows: 1 lan@example.com | 2 minh@example.com | 3 an@example.com\n\nThe same two inputs with a parameter (safe):\n  → 0 rows: (none)\n  → 0 rows: (none)\n\nSearch box: \"Bob's\" — an honest apostrophe:\n  SQL sent: SELECT id, title FROM posts WHERE published = 1 AND title LIKE '%Bob's%'\n  unsafe → near \"s\": syntax error\n  → 0 rows: (none)",
 "_t8/out/joins-count": "sqlite> SELECT users.name, count(posts.id) AS posts FROM users LEFT JOIN posts ON posts.user_id = users.id GROUP BY users.id ORDER BY posts DESC;\n+------+-------+\n| name | posts |\n+------+-------+\n| Lan  |     3 |\n| Minh |     2 |\n| An   |     0 |\n+------+-------+\n\nsqlite> SELECT users.name, count(posts.id) AS posts FROM users INNER JOIN posts ON posts.user_id = users.id GROUP BY users.id ORDER BY posts DESC;\n+------+-------+\n| name | posts |\n+------+-------+\n| Lan  |     3 |\n| Minh |     2 |\n+------+-------+\n\nsqlite> SELECT p.title, u.name AS commenter, c.body FROM comments c JOIN posts p ON p.id = c.post_id JOIN users u ON u.id = c.user_id ORDER BY c.id;\n+----------------+-----------+-----------------------------+\n|     title      | commenter |            body             |\n+----------------+-----------+-----------------------------+\n| Hello World    | Minh      | Welcome!                    |\n| Hello World    | An        | Nice start                  |\n| Node.js Basics | Lan       | Very clear, thanks          |\n| Node.js Basics | An        | Can you cover Express next? |\n| Learning SQL   | Minh      | SQL finally makes sense     |\n+----------------+-----------+-----------------------------+",
