 "_t8/out/transaction": "-- (a) Move 700 000 from Minh to Lan with two separate statements, no transaction:\nsqlite> UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance + 700000 WHERE id = 1;\nsqlite> UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 700000 WHERE id = 2;\nError near line 2: CHECK constraint failed: balance >= 0\n+----+-------+---------+\n| id | owner | balance |\n+----+-------+---------+\n|  1 | Lan   | 1200000 |\n|  2 | Minh  |  100000 |\n+----+-------+---------+\n\n-- (b) Inside BEGIN … COMMIT, but the script keeps going after the error:\nsqlite> BEGIN;\nsqlite> UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance + 700000 WHERE id = 1;\nsqlite> UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 700000 WHERE id = 2;\nsqlite> COMMIT;\nError near line 3: CHECK constraint failed: balance >= 0\n+----+-------+---------+\n| id | owner | balance |\n+----+-------+---------+\n|  1 | Lan   | 1200000 |\n|  2 | Minh  |  100000 |\n+----+-------+---------+\n\n-- (c) Inside BEGIN … COMMIT, stopping at the first error (sqlite3 -bail) — the transaction is rolled back:\nError near line 3: CHECK constraint failed: balance >= 0\n+----+-------+---------+\n| id | owner | balance |\n+----+-------+---------+\n|  1 | Lan   |  500000 |\n|  2 | Minh  |  100000 |\n+----+-------+---------+",
